cmu-buryable-mine-placed = You pull the pin on {THE($mine)}. Dig it in with a shovel to arm it.
cmu-buryable-mine-unfold = Unfold {THE($tool)} first.
cmu-buryable-mine-burying = You start burying {THE($mine)}.
cmu-buryable-mine-buried = You finish burying {THE($mine)}. It will arm in a few seconds.
cmu-buryable-mine-click = {CAPITALIZE(THE($mine))} clicks underfoot, but doesn't go off.
cmu-buryable-mine-examine-armed = [color=red]It's buried, armed and ready.[/color]
cmu-buryable-mine-examine-instructions = A small label on the bottom reads: 'To deploy, pull the pin and dig it in with your standard-issue e-tool. It arms {$seconds} seconds after being buried.'
